{"items": [{"id": "1.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "月下絮語", "en": "Whispers Under the Moon"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": true, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "他側躺在月色裡撐著頭看妳——入夜時光的開場景。示範：標成「開場景」的 CG，會在 AI 進入對應模式時自動顯示。", "en": "Lying on his side in the moonlight, head propped on one hand, looking at you. The opening scene for the night. Demo: a CG marked as the opening scene shows automatically when the AI enters the matching mode."}}, {"id": "2.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "月色相邀", "en": "Moonlit Invitation"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "他朝妳伸出手，掌心向著月光也向著妳。示範：AI 可依對話情節下指令切換到任一張 CG。", "en": "He reaches out to you, palm turned to the moonlight and to you. Demo: the AI can switch to any CG as the conversation unfolds."}}, {"id": "3.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "傾身入懷", "en": "Into His Arms"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "拉住那隻手的下一瞬，世界傾斜——妳落進他懷裡。", "en": "The instant you take that hand, the world tilts, and you fall into his arms."}}, {"id": "4.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "咫尺凝眸", "en": "A Breath Away"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "近得能數清他的睫毛，他卻還笑著不肯先開口。", "en": "Close enough to count his lashes, and still he smiles and won't be the first to speak."}}, {"id": "5.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "月色傾覆", "en": "Moonlight Eclipsed"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "月光被他的肩線擋住，夜色忽然只剩下彼此的輪廓。", "en": "His shoulder blocks the moonlight, and suddenly the night holds nothing but the two of you."}}, {"id": "6.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "燭影微醺", "en": "Tipsy Candlelight"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "燭火在他眼底晃，像微醺，又像蓄謀已久的溫柔。", "en": "Candlelight sways in his eyes, like a tipsy warmth, like a tenderness planned long ago."}}, {"id": "7.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "指尖輕喚", "en": "A Beckoning Fingertip"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "他趴在月光裡朝妳勾了勾指尖——過來，這裡暖。", "en": "Sprawled in the moonlight, he crooks a finger at you: come here, it's warm."}}, {"id": "8.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "溺於夜色", "en": "Drowning in Night"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "夜深了，月光淋在交疊的呼吸上——今晚不說再見。", "en": "Deep into the night, moonlight pours over tangled breaths. No goodbyes tonight."}}, {"id": "9.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "月色屏息", "en": "Held Breath"}, "target": "desktop", "opening": false, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "近到連月光都插不進來，妳聽見他放輕的呼吸。", "en": "So close that even the moonlight can't get between you; you hear his breathing soften."}}, {"id": "m1.png", "name": {"zh-Hant": "月夜之約", "en": "Moonlit Promise"}, "target": "mobile", "opening": true, "desc": {"zh-Hant": "他在月窗前朝妳伸手——手機版的開場景。示範：手機組與桌機組各自獨立，直式構圖專屬手機畫面。", "en": "He reaches for you at the moonlit window. The mobile opening scene. Demo: mobile and desktop sets are independent; portrait compositions are used for mobile screens."}}]}